# Read upstream before changing runner env

Do not invent or flip `DISABLE_*`, `CONFIGURED_*`, or image tags from logs alone.

1. Read this repo’s `README.md` and `docker-compose.yml` comments.
2. Confirm every key against [myoung34/docker-github-actions-runner README](https://github.com/myoung34/docker-github-actions-runner/blob/master/README.md) and [Usage wiki](https://github.com/myoung34/docker-github-actions-runner/wiki/Usage).
3. For updates, prefer floating `latest` + pull/recreate; do not hardcode a version as the long-term default.

```text
# ❌ Guess from a crash loop
DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE: "false"   # still truthy on this image
image: "...:2.338.2"             # will deprecate; not a forever default

# ✅ Docs-backed
# DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE any value => --disableupdate (container path)
# latest rebuilt by myoung34; refresh with docker compose pull + recreate
image: "myoung34/github-runner:${GITHUB_RUNNER_IMAGE_TAG:-latest}"
pull_policy: always
DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE: "true"
```
